Package: cellpal
Title: Colour Palettes for Single-Cell and Scientific Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Yvon",
        family = "Mbouamboua",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "your.email@example.com"
    )
Description: Provides categorical, sequential, and diverging colour palettes
    designed for single-cell genomics and general scientific visualization.
    Includes ggplot2 scales, stable category mappings, colour adjustment
    utilities, and colour-vision-deficiency diagnostics.
